c0O49","user":{"login":"jgill88","id":10379307,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzc5MzA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10379307?u=7db9f18df8354568cbcf381bb38b5037fab7212e&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88","html_url":"https://github.com/jgill88","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jgill88/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"thanks for adding my proposal, @MartinDelille !\r\n\r\nTested the following (bfcf4562e293609761910336007d095df5df3e63) on intel mbp 15.7:\r\n\r\n# Global quick open\r\n\r\n## Repeated shortcuts\r\n\r\neach correctly simulates a keydown press. \r\n\r\n- global quick open (cmd+p+p+p+p+p release) - works perfectly\r\n- global scene quick open (shift+cmd+o+o+o+o release) - works perfectly\r\n- global script quick open (opt+cmd+o+o+o+o release) - works perfectly!\r\n\r\n## Switching types\r\n\r\n- Switched between all quick open types using shortcuts, once global quick open was opened - works as expected\r\n\r\n# Non-global quick open \r\n\r\nRight click a theme in the inspector-> quick load... \r\n\r\nAs expected, no shortcuts caused the dialog's file type filters to change, and no shortcuts caused the 'keydown' keypress simulation to occur. \r\n\r\n## tested all shortcuts:\r\n\r\n- global cmd+p: no change of open type, no navigation motion\r\n- global script cmd+opt+o: no change of open type, no navigation motion\r\n- global scene shift+cmd+o: no change of open type, no navigation motion\r\n\r\nreally nice improvement :)","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112736#pullrequestreview-3704679997","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112736","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112736#pullrequestreview-3704679997"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112736"}},"submitted_at":"2026-01-26T05:29:08Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3990449967,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7t2W8v","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112736#pullrequestreview-3990449967","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112736","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112